---
system: sys-07-parent-controls-summary
flow_id: parent-gate-validate
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/07-parent-controls-summary#post-v1parentauth
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, IdentityService, Redis, PostgreSQL]
apis:
  - POST /v1/parent/auth
  - POST /v1/parent/lockout/clear
externals: []
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - rate_limited
  - account_locked_out
  - pin_incorrect
  - network_partition
idempotency: not idempotent — auth attempts are inherently stateful
retry: no automatic retry — each attempt counts against rate-limit budget
timeout: 1s p99 for bcrypt compare path (300ms p50)
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant IdentityService
    participant Redis
    participant PostgreSQL

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: ADR-0005 D3 — server auth order: (1) Redis rate-limit, (2) lockout precheck, (3) bcrypt compare, (4) attempt row insert

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/parent/auth {pin, X-Request-Id} and Authorization: Bearer {parent_access_token}
    Gateway->>Gateway: validate parent JWT signature, extract user_id and ip_hash
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward request with user_id, ip_hash

    Note over IdentityService,Redis: Step 1 — Redis token-bucket rate-limit (10 attempts / 5 min per user_id+ip_hash)
    IdentityService->>Redis: INCR and EXPIRE rate_limit:parent_auth:{user_id}:{ip_hash}
    alt rate_limited (bucket exhausted — count > 10 within 5min window)
        Redis-->>IdentityService: count > 10
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 429 rate_limited {retry_after_seconds} (NO attempt row written)
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 429
    else within_rate_limit
        Redis-->>IdentityService: count <= 10

        Note over IdentityService,PostgreSQL: Step 2 — lockout precheck
        IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT locked_until FROM parent_lockouts WHERE user_id={user_id} AND locked_until > now()
        alt account_locked_out
            PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: locked_until (future timestamp)
            IdentityService-->>Gateway: 423 account_locked_out {locked_until, retry_after_seconds}
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 423
        else not_locked_out
            PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: no row (or locked_until <= now())

            Note over IdentityService,PostgreSQL: Step 3 — bcrypt compare
            IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT bcrypt_hash, failed_since FROM parent_pins WHERE user_id={user_id}
            PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: pin record
            IdentityService->>IdentityService: bcrypt.compare(pin, bcrypt_hash) — ~300ms p50

            alt pin_incorrect
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT parent_auth_attempts {user_id, succeeded: false, ip_hash, attempted_at}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: inserted
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM parent_auth_attempts WHERE user_id={user_id} AND succeeded=false AND attempted_at > now()-interval '15min'
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: failure_count
                alt failure_count >= 5 (lockout threshold)
                    IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT parent_lockouts {user_id, locked_until: now()+interval '15min'} ON CONFLICT (user_id) DO UPDATE SET locked_until=EXCLUDED.locked_until
                    PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: locked
                    IdentityService-->>Gateway: 423 account_locked_out {locked_until}
                    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 423
                else below_lockout_threshold
                    IdentityService-->>Gateway: 401 pin_incorrect {attempts_remaining}
                    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 401
                end
            else network_partition
                IdentityService-->>Gateway: 503 network_partition
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 503
            else pin_correct
                Note over IdentityService,PostgreSQL: Step 4 — insert success attempt row and issue parent_session JWT
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT parent_auth_attempts {user_id, succeeded: true, ip_hash, attempted_at}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: inserted
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT parent_sessions {jti: uuid(), user_id, idle_until: now()+interval '15min', expires_at: now()+interval '24h', created_at, ip_hash}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: session_id
                IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {parent_session_token: JWT{jti, user_id, idle_until, expires_at}, session_expires_at}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
                ParentApp->>ParentApp: store parent_session {jti, idle_until, expires_at} in parent.store
            end
        end
    end

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: --- Lockout clear (primary-parent only, ADR-0005 D4) ---

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/parent/lockout/clear {target_user_id}
    Gateway->>Gateway: require valid parent JWT and primary_parent role claim
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward
    IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: DELETE FROM parent_lockouts WHERE user_id={target_user_id}
    PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: deleted
    IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {cleared: true}
    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200

    Note over ParentApp,PostgreSQL: timeout 1s p99 (bcrypt path) — no retry — not idempotent — ADR-0005 D3 server order enforced — parent_session JWT: idle_until 15min, expires_at 24h
